---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ProjectVisual from '../../components/ProjectVisual.astro';
import { withBase } from '../../lib/url';
---

<Layout title="实验室">
  <div class="page">
    <header class="page-header">
      <span class="eyebrow">LAB / ROOM FOR CURIOSITY</span>
      <h1>把“如果”变成可以观察。</h1>
      <p>调一个参数，看一种关系。这些浏览器里的交互实验，用真实计算帮助理解抽象概念。</p>
    </header>
    <article class="lab-feature">
      <ProjectVisual id="signal-studio" />
      <div>
        <span class="badge">数学合成 · 交互实验</span>
        <h2>看见信号的另一面。</h2>
        <p>
          两路正弦，一点噪声，一组采样参数。在时域与幅度谱之间，观察频率、窗函数和混叠如何改变图形。
        </p>
        <div class="tag-list">
          <span class="tag">FFT</span>
          <span class="tag">时域 / 频域</span>
          <span class="tag">确定性噪声</span>
        </div>
        <a class="button primary" href={withBase('/lab/signal-studio/')}>
          进入信号实验室 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </article>
    <p class="small muted lab-note">
      教学与可视化演示，结果为数学合成序列。实验不读取你的文件，不模拟经过校准的硬件测量。
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
<style>
  .lab-feature {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--surface);
  }
  .lab-feature > div:last-child {
    padding: 40px;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .lab-feature :global(.project-visual) {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    border-bottom: 0;
  }
  .lab-feature :global(svg) {
    height: 290px;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 29px;
    margin: 20px 0 17px;
  }
  .lab-feature p {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .lab-feature .button {
    margin-top: 28px;
  }
  .lab-note {
    margin-top: 20px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .lab-feature {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .lab-feature > div:last-child {
      padding: 25px;
      border-left: 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .lab-feature :global(svg) {
      height: 210px;
    }
    h2 {
      font-size: 25px;
    }
  }
</style>
